  "title": "PENN Entertainment to Report Second Quarter Results and Host Conference Call and Webcast on August 6",
  "summary": "WYOMISSING, Pa. --(BUSINESS WIRE)--Jun. 29, 2026-- PENN Entertainment, Inc. (Nasdaq: PENN) announced today that it will release its 2026 second quarter financial results at 7:00 a.m. ET on Thursday, August 6, 2026, followed by a conference call and simultaneous webcast at 9:00 a.m. ET.",
